  m_Name: Cylinder.003_Chrome.001_0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Exhaust Manifold Right
  description: The Exhaust Manifold Right is a large, elongated component positioned
    at the middle-center-center of the engine, tasked with collecting exhaust gases
    from the cylinders and directing them towards the exhaust system. Made of Chrome.001,
    its substantial size and strategic location enable it to efficiently collect
    and expel exhaust gases from the right bank of cylinders. Notably, the Exhaust
    Manifold Right's design and material help to reduce backpressure and minimize
    heat transfer to surrounding components, while its larger size accommodates the
    engine's high-performance requirements.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d754ac7ab0d271b458687633b7625293, type: 3}
